his is expected for recent works and is not a sign of low quality.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 4 of 4 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2019: mean 7.9, median 2.5, top work 39. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Recent years: works from 2024–2026 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2018–2019, 2021–2022 and 2024–2026 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2017, 2020 and 2023 have fewer than 10 works (2017: 6, 2020: 5, 2023: 6), too few for a band. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."]}}}